---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
import '@fontsource/source-sans-pro'
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Astro</title>
	</head>
	<body class="max-w-screen-sm mx-auto text-gray-900 font-[Source_Sans_Pro]">

		<nav class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
			<button class="sm:hidden">
				<Icon name={"tabler:menu-2"} />
			</button>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
				<a href="" class="font-bold">Ibrahim Al-Anshor</a>

				<div class="hidden sm:flex sm:gap-4">
					<a href="">Tulisan</a>
					<a href="">Proyek</a>
					<a href="">Tentang</a>
					<a href="">Kontak</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<button>
				<Icon name={"tabler:moon"} />
			</button>
		</nav>

		<div class="px-4 py-8">
			<h1 class="mb-4 font-bold text-3xl flex items-center gap-2">
				<Icon name={"twemoji:waving-hand"} />
				Halo! Saya Ibrahim!
			</h1>

			<p class="mb-4 text-base/7">Saya seorang web developer, biasa menggunakan <code class="bg-gray-200 text-gray-900 font-mono py-0.5 px-1 text-sm rounded">Vue.js</code> dan <code class="bg-gray-200 text-gray-900 font-mono py-0.5 px-1 text-sm rounded">Laravel</code>. Di blog ini saya akan berbagi tulisan seputar coding dan proyek aplikasi yang saya kembangkan.</p>

			<p class="mb-4 text-base/7">Buat kamu yang membutuhkan jasa pembuatan website, aplikasi atau ingin konsultasi, bisa hubungi saya di <a href="ibrahimalanshor6@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">ibrahimalanshor6@gmail.com</a>, saya siap membantu kamu.</p>

			<p class="mb-4 text-base/7">Kalau kamu butuh mentor untuk belajar coding atau ingin konsultasi seputar coding, bisa juga hubungi saya.</p>

			<h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
				Hubungi Saya
			</h2>
			
			<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-4">
				<a href="" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:underline">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-linkedin" /> Linkedin
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:underline">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-instagram" /> Instagram
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:underline">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-twitter" /> Twitter
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:underline">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-facebook" /> Facebook
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:underline">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-github" /> Github
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded hover:underline">
					<Icon name="tabler:brand-youtube" /> Youtube
				</a>
			</div>

			<h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
				Jasa Saya
			</h2>

			<ol class="space-y-4">
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gray-100 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
							<Icon name="twemoji:globe-showing-asia-australia" />
						</div>
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-semibold">Pembuatan Website</a>
							<p class="text-gray-500">Pembuatan website custom apa saja</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="" class="text-blue-600">
						<Icon name={"tabler:arrow-right"} />
					</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
