				</li>
				<li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 items-center">
					<span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">26 Okt</span>
					<span class="w-1 h-1 bg-gray-200 rounded-full"></span>
					<span class="text-sm text-gray-500">javascript</span>
					<a href="" class="block w-full font-semibold">Kapan Menggunakan let di Javascript</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 items-center">
					<span class="text-gray-500 text-sm">14 Okt</span>
